---
import Layout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Nepal Hypnosis | Pioneer Psychotherapy Clinic" description="Learn about Nepal Hypnosis, founded in 2012 AD in Kathmandu by Archana Bibhor, providing pioneer psychotherapy and mental well-being services.">
  <main class="py-16 bg-[#FAF8F5]">
    <div class="container-nh max-w-4xl mx-auto bg-white p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-3xl shadow-sm border border-[#e2e8f0]">
      <span class="text-[11px] font-extrabold tracking-[0.2em] text-[#D84315] uppercase mb-3 block">Established 2012 AD</span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#173A7A] mb-6">About Nepal Hypnosis</h1>
      
      <div class="prose max-w-none text-[#475569] space-y-6 leading-relaxed">
        <p class="text-lg font-medium text-[#173A7A]">
          Nepal Hypnosis is a pioneer psychotherapy clinic and training center located in Kathmandu, Nepal, operating continuously since 2012 AD.
        </p>
        <p>
          Founded by <strong>Archana Bibhor</strong>, our institution was established with a singular vision: to provide individualized, confidential, and evidence-informed mental health care that treats each person as a whole rather than a diagnosis.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#173A7A] pt-4">Our Philosophy & Approach</h2>
        <p>
          Emotional difficulties often stem from a complex web of past experiences, core beliefs, and relationship dynamics. Our eclectic psychotherapeutic framework blends talk-based cognitive therapies, experiential Gestalt work, and clinical hypnotherapy to foster genuine, sustainable healing.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#173A7A] pt-4">Leadership</h2>
        <div class="bg-[#F5F1EA] p-6 rounded-2xl border border-[#e2e8f0] flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-6 items-center">
          <img src="/images/archana-bibhor1.png" alt="Archana Bibhor" width="120" height="120" class="rounded-xl object-cover shadow-sm shrink-0" />
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#173A7A]">Archana Bibhor</h3>
            <p class="text-sm font-bold text-[#385BAA] mb-2">Founder & Lead Clinical Practitioner</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-[#475569]">
              PsyD Candidate in Clinical Psychology (USIU-Africa) with over 20 years of professional practice in psychotherapy, counseling, and education.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 text-center pt-6 border-t border-[#e2e8f0]">
          <a href="https://portal.nepalhypnosis.com/form/consultation-request" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex rounded-xl bg-[#D84315] px-8 py-3.5 text-base font-bold text-white shadow-md hover:bg-[#b93812] transition">
            Request a Consultation →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>